From cfe4dbce148def64a897545019dcce63560da102 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TNlucfer01 <ihdaa2006@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 03:23:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add role-based auth and admin dashboard API

- Login returns role; blocks deactivated users; case-insensitive email match
- requireAuth re-reads role and is_active from the database on each request
- Add requireRole middleware; /api/admin is admin-only, /api/user is user-only
- Implement /api/admin/dashboard: overview, users, users/:id, projects,
  tasks, rank and attendance, built on the performance views
- Update /api/tasks to the new schema (assigned_to, status, deadline, project)
- JSON error handler for thrown errors and invalid JSON bodies
- Update frontend User and Task types; document roles and dashboard API
